<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Varig 1996 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Brazil Varig 1996 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian airline Varig released the following statement on its 1996 results:</p>
<p>		1996		     1995</p>
<p>	   97.1 million profit	7.5 million loss</p>
<p>Varig said the better result was primarily due to a cost-cutting campaign that slashed 140 million reais from the books last year. It said the campaign would continue in 1997.</p>
<p>All figures given in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>((--John Miller, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248-5414))</p>
</text>
